{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "RAYA Universal Crop Master Blueprint Schema v1",
  "description": "The standard knowledge structure every crop in RAYA must follow. Rice is the reference implementation. All future crops (Wheat, Maize, Cotton, Sugarcane, etc.) use this same blueprint. Organized into 3 layers: Layer-1 Crop-Level Knowledge, Layer-2 Stage-Level Knowledge (repeated for every growth stage), Layer-3 Intelligence Relationships.",
